ordinary_real_factor.jl is a modified Julia translation of Michael Wimmer's
PFAPACK DSKTF2 (upper/normal) and DSKR2, distributed with mVMC 1.4.0 (unchanged since 1.3.0).
Authoritative source: src/pfapack/fortran/dsktf2.f lines208-260 and
dskr2.f lines162-178. The source-adjacent ordinary_real_factor.LICENSE
reproduces upstream LapackLicence copyright notices, conditions and disclaimer.
The private port preserves the C update association and does not extend or
replace methods in the PfaPack dependency. Its scalar factor loop deliberately
omits vectorizing/fastmath macros. Dependency gitlinks and solver are unchanged.
